WEBVTT

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:31.213
Think of the brain as basically
filling up with a lot of volumes.

00:07:31.237 --> 00:07:34.335
And that means you have a lot
of crystallized intelligence.

00:07:34.994 --> 00:07:38.241
AG: Depth and breadth of knowledge
aren't the only benefits of aging.

00:07:38.265 --> 00:07:41.321
Evidence suggests that self-control
and socio-emotional skills

00:07:41.345 --> 00:07:43.219
often keep climbing, too.

00:07:43.243 --> 00:07:46.303
Many of us continue gaining willpower
and emotional intelligence

00:07:46.327 --> 00:07:48.440
well into our 40s and 50s.

00:07:48.464 --> 00:07:51.002
We're still getting better
at delaying gratification,

00:07:51.026 --> 00:07:52.595
reading other people's emotions

00:07:52.619 --> 00:07:54.221
and regulating our own moods.

00:07:54.245 --> 00:07:56.395
Even into our 70s and 80s,

00:07:56.419 --> 00:07:59.392
we're still improving
at ignoring sunk costs,

00:07:59.416 --> 00:08:02.452
all of which can enhance
our job performance.